### Access and evidence audit

The configured search integration returned HTTP 402, including its simpler retry. Direct DuckDuckGo HTML search subsequently worked and supplied observer/reseller-status articles, which were fetched in full. Fresh primary OpenAI model-index and live gateway checks found no exact public listing; the candidate OpenAI model page and BenchLM profile returned 404, both confirmed via shell HTTP fallback. These findings are bounded public-access checks, not proof that an internal model does not exist or that all web access is blocked. No repository model metadata or other reporters' files supplied evidence.

